## 💻 Implemented Features (SRS Aligned)

1. **Landing & Home Page (`/`)**:
   - Platform overview, statistics counter, featured course catalog, navigation.
2. **Authentication (`/login`)**:
   - JWT-based authentication with Sign In & Registration tabs.
   - Support for **Learner**, **Instructor**, and **Admin** roles.
3. **Course Catalog (`/catalog`)**:
   - Course grid with real-time text search, category filters, and difficulty level filters.
4. **Course Details (`/courses/:id`)**:
   - Complete curriculum outline with expandable module accordions, lesson lists, assessment markers, and dynamic enrollment.
5. **Course Player (`/learn/:courseId`)**:
   - Lesson navigation sidebar, integrated video player (YouTube/embed support), text content viewer, and progress checkmarks.
6. **MCQ Quiz & Assessment (`/assessments/:id`)**:
   - Quiz interface with live countdown timer, radio options for options A-D, auto-scoring, and immediate submission.
7. **Assessment Results (`/assessments/:id/results`)**:
   - Score overview, pass/fail status badge, percentage calculation, and detailed answer review with correct/incorrect highlights.
8. **Learner Dashboard (`/dashboard`)**:
   - Stat cards (Total Courses, Enrollments, Completed, Unread Alerts), quick actions, and enrolled course shortcuts.
9. **Notifications Inbox (`/notifications`)**:
   - Interactive notification list with read/unread indicators, mark as read, and delete functionality.
10. **Certificates (`/certificates`)**:
    - Earned achievement cards with issue dates and certificate links.
11. **Discussion Forum (`/discussions`)**:
    - Threaded discussion listing with modal/form for creating new lesson discussions.
12. **Admin Course Management (`/admin/courses`)**:
    - Full CRUD data table for creating, editing, and deleting courses with modal dialogs.
13. **Admin User & Audit Logs (`/admin/users`)**:
    - Audit log monitoring table detailing platform user actions, timestamps, and entity changes.

